WEBVTT

00:03.700 --> 00:05.060
Logos...

00:06.300 --> 00:08.200
That's what she called herself?

00:08.700 --> 00:11.610
Do you know them, Grandma?

00:13.140 --> 00:18.050
They are a group from a distant land seeking Onikirimaru.

00:18.580 --> 00:21.350
Recently, they joined Logos and entered

00:21.350 --> 00:25.790
this village as the underlings of a woman named Monado.

00:26.550 --> 00:30.690
They are most likely stronger than you,

00:30.690 --> 00:34.600
and have already stolen one of the Artifacts.

00:35.360 --> 00:36.330
Grandma...

00:36.330 --> 00:40.830
It is impossible for you to restore the Artifacts's seal.

00:42.870 --> 00:45.840
This is because you have not realized yourself

00:45.840 --> 00:48.210
as the Tamayori princess.

00:49.040 --> 00:50.550
What does that mean?

00:50.550 --> 00:55.520
The gradually weakening
Tamayori princess seals

00:55.520 --> 00:58.680
were made with Tamayori blood.

00:59.190 --> 01:01.090
If your Tamayori blood awakens

01:01.090 --> 01:04.530
and you perform the ritual of the seal,

01:04.530 --> 01:07.000
the seal's power should be restored.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.290
But how do I awaken it?

01:10.500 --> 01:12.370
Can you see anything there?

01:12.370 --> 01:13.300
Huh?

01:14.040 --> 01:15.130
Um...

01:17.110 --> 01:18.540
You are still far from it.

01:19.770 --> 01:21.210
The guardians should

01:21.210 --> 01:24.240
prioritize protecting the remaining Artifacts.

01:24.880 --> 01:27.180
The fewer Artifacts we have,

01:27.180 --> 01:29.150
the more Onikirimaru's power

01:29.150 --> 01:31.420
will enrage nearby kami.

01:31.420 --> 01:32.940
We will not be able to stop them.

01:33.760 --> 01:36.720
The five guardian houses should focus their efforts on this,

01:36.720 --> 01:39.420
and protect the remaining four seals.

01:40.230 --> 01:41.560
We shall.

01:41.560 --> 01:42.930
However...

01:43.230 --> 01:46.900
Only a Tamayori priestess should be able to

01:46.900 --> 01:50.700
dispel the chain of seals formed by the five Artifacts.

01:51.110 --> 01:53.540
How did Logos do this?

01:55.480 --> 01:57.410
I doubt you have fought opponents

01:57.410 --> 02:01.470
stronger than yourselves until now.

02:01.780 --> 02:05.150
You must abandon your pride and fight with everything you have.

02:05.150 --> 02:08.720
Strength is not the only thing which determines the outcome of the battle.

02:08.960 --> 02:14.160
If Onikirimaru's power is released, the world will end.

02:14.160 --> 02:16.560
Do not forget this.

03:48.260 --> 03:53.030
It seems we've rediscovered something terrible.

03:53.030 --> 03:54.760
I'm sorry.

03:54.230 --> 03:57.530
The

03:54.230 --> 03:57.530
Two

03:54.230 --> 03:57.530
Tasks

03:54.760 --> 03:56.760
This is all happening because

03:56.760 --> 03:58.730
I haven't realized my power yet.

03:59.200 --> 04:01.300
No, it's not your fault.

04:01.300 --> 04:03.570
Don't let this get you down.

04:03.640 --> 04:04.800
But...

04:05.240 --> 04:07.110
I'm sure what Onizaki is trying to say is

04:07.110 --> 04:09.480
you shouldn't worry about this on your own.

04:10.040 --> 04:11.410
Right, Onizaki?

04:14.450 --> 04:15.920
But...

04:17.190 --> 04:19.820
Tamaki, have you forgotten?

04:19.820 --> 04:23.850
Protecting the Tamayori princess is a guardian's job.

04:24.130 --> 04:26.890
Yeah, we're ready for this.

04:26.890 --> 04:29.400
It's why I came back.

04:29.400 --> 04:30.630
Don't let it bother you.

04:30.630 --> 04:33.120
You should not feel responsible.

04:34.070 --> 04:35.370
Come on.

04:35.870 --> 04:39.710
You should have more faith in us and let us support you.

04:39.710 --> 04:42.200
What was that? I couldn't hear you.

04:42.780 --> 04:45.150
Don't make me say it again!

04:45.150 --> 04:46.510
Guys...

04:46.510 --> 04:48.750
I'll do my best.

04:48.750 --> 04:51.420
I'll do my best to realize my power,

04:51.420 --> 04:52.940
and protect Onikirimaru.

04:54.820 --> 04:57.660
First you were sad, and now you're happy already?

04:57.660 --> 04:58.990
You're a busy girl.

04:58.990 --> 05:00.020
But...

05:00.500 --> 05:04.670
We must come up with a plan to defeat Logos.

05:04.670 --> 05:05.790
Yeah!

05:06.830 --> 05:09.040
Dinner is ready.

05:09.040 --> 05:11.210
I am sorry it took so long.

05:11.210 --> 05:13.400
Oh, right. We haven't eaten anything yet.

05:13.910 --> 05:15.440
That smells great.

05:15.440 --> 05:17.280
Is that meat? It's meat, isn't it?

05:18.680 --> 05:21.180
We can talk about that stuff after dinner, right?

05:21.180 --> 05:23.350
You can't fight on an empty stomach.

05:23.350 --> 05:25.820
Mahiro, you can be quite insightful sometimes.

05:25.820 --> 05:27.910
Why'd you have to say "sometimes?"

05:30.730 --> 05:33.790
What a feast. There's so much meat.

05:34.060 --> 05:37.660
There's plenty more, so eat as much as you'd like.

05:37.970 --> 05:41.200
Mitsuru poured her heart into this food.

05:41.800 --> 05:43.540
Let's eat our fill, restore our spirits,

05:43.540 --> 05:44.740
and protect the seals.

05:44.740 --> 05:45.740
Let's do it.

05:45.740 --> 05:47.640
Let's eat!

05:50.980 --> 05:53.110
I'm not giving any of Mitsuru's food

05:53.110 --> 05:54.950
to someone who doesn't listen.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.250
I'm listening.

05:58.890 --> 06:00.080
Upperclassman!

06:02.660 --> 06:03.760
It fell.

06:03.760 --> 06:05.090
It fell.

06:05.090 --> 06:06.590
You can't eat it anymore.

06:06.590 --> 06:08.150
You cannot eat it.

06:11.000 --> 06:12.690
I'll eat it.

06:13.870 --> 06:15.230
Upperclassman.

06:22.640 --> 06:24.370
Thanks, Mitsuru.

06:25.280 --> 06:27.050
It was delicious.

06:27.050 --> 06:29.550
Thanks to you, everyone's feeling better.

06:29.550 --> 06:32.420
I am just glad everyone's happy.

06:32.420 --> 06:34.320
It's true, Kotokura.

06:34.720 --> 06:37.560
Your cooking's really improved.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.060
Where's everyone else?

06:41.060 --> 06:42.550
They left already.

06:46.000 --> 06:47.590
I'll give you a hand.

06:53.440 --> 06:56.710
I will do this.

06:56.710 --> 06:58.940
Please leave.

07:01.320 --> 07:04.220
Did I do something to upset her?

07:06.520 --> 07:08.720
Is there something on my face?

07:09.760 --> 07:11.750
No, nothing.

07:12.590 --> 07:16.030
Right, right. I get it.

07:16.030 --> 07:18.020
Oh, Mitsuru.

07:37.520 --> 07:40.180
The miasma has thinned here.

07:42.420 --> 07:45.090
Monado's power is here.

07:46.060 --> 07:49.430
It's only natural demons would relinquish

07:49.430 --> 07:51.230
their own territory.

07:51.230 --> 07:52.890
What is Drei doing?

07:53.370 --> 07:56.570
He's still examining the Artifact

07:56.570 --> 07:58.230
we got the other day.

07:58.470 --> 08:01.200
That fool. Call him.

08:01.510 --> 08:04.450
There's no need.

08:06.410 --> 08:10.780
The Artifact is a unique object.

08:11.150 --> 08:14.780
It does more than simply seal power.

08:15.520 --> 08:21.500
You're saying we cannot simply destroy it?

08:21.500 --> 08:24.800
As I am not sure of the specifics,

08:24.800 --> 08:29.430
you'll have to wait to handle the seals and Artifacts.

08:29.740 --> 08:34.210
It seems to be a device for controlling massive magical power.

08:34.210 --> 08:36.940
We should handle it discreetly.

08:38.350 --> 08:40.470
Do whatever you want.

08:40.850 --> 08:42.840
We can destroy the seals any time.

08:43.750 --> 08:45.220
Very well.

08:52.030 --> 08:56.860
There's Sybil. The priestess guarding Onikirimaru.

08:58.670 --> 08:59.900
Vier.

08:59.900 --> 09:00.800
Yes?

09:01.840 --> 09:03.460
Am I a sacred maiden?

09:03.870 --> 09:08.210
Yes. You are the world's most important maiden.

09:08.580 --> 09:10.240
Monado Aria.

09:11.280 --> 09:12.470
Sing.

09:32.070 --> 09:33.530
I'm fine.

09:33.530 --> 09:36.940
There's just been too much happening lately.

09:37.370 --> 09:41.830
<i>It is impossible for you to restore the Artifacts' seal.</i>

09:42.410 --> 09:45.080
<i>This is because you have not realized yourself</i>

09:45.080 --> 09:47.780
<i>as the Tamayori princess.</i>

09:48.050 --> 09:49.980
<i>Can you see anything there?</i>

09:50.320 --> 09:52.450
What was I supposed to see?

09:54.390 --> 09:56.720
You don't know either?

09:56.720 --> 09:59.360
But if that's my only clue,

09:59.360 --> 10:02.420
I have to keep trying until I see something.

10:08.900 --> 10:11.200
You're going to do it with me?

10:11.810 --> 10:13.470
Thanks, O-chan.

10:14.810 --> 10:16.040
Okay.

10:24.590 --> 10:25.810
I saw it.

10:27.290 --> 10:28.590
Huh?

10:30.590 --> 10:31.390
No way!

10:38.170 --> 10:39.800
Good morning, Mitsuru.

10:39.800 --> 10:41.800
What about breakfast?

10:41.800 --> 10:44.110
Sorry, I'm going to be late.

10:44.110 --> 10:45.630
Then take this.

10:46.370 --> 10:49.040
Thanks. See you later.

10:50.540 --> 10:54.410
Lady Baba and I are going to the shrine today.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.790
I made it.

11:05.790 --> 11:06.890
Good morning.

11:06.890 --> 11:09.420
You don't usually get here just in time.

11:22.140 --> 11:23.410
Takuma.

11:23.410 --> 11:26.850
What's wrong? You seem tired.

11:34.160 --> 11:35.350
Guys?

11:36.690 --> 11:38.920
Are you not feeling well?

11:39.560 --> 11:41.960
The night we met with
Lady Baba and last night,

11:41.960 --> 11:44.990
we've been out keeping watch over the Artifacts.

11:45.430 --> 11:48.000
What? Does that mean you haven't

11:48.000 --> 11:49.500
gotten any sleep the last two days?

11:49.500 --> 11:52.470
Yeah, better safe than sorry.

11:52.810 --> 11:54.840
How did your watch go?

11:54.840 --> 11:56.040
Nothing.

11:56.040 --> 11:57.480
Same.

11:57.480 --> 11:59.250
Me, too.

11:59.250 --> 12:02.310
When Ohmi checked this morning, he said the same thing.

12:02.780 --> 12:05.250
I'm glad you're all okay.

12:05.850 --> 12:07.880
Complacency's our greatest enemy.

12:08.460 --> 12:10.760
But don't you think it's strange?

12:10.760 --> 12:11.830
What is?

12:11.830 --> 12:15.430
Well, with the rest of the seals destroyed,

12:15.430 --> 12:18.270
you'd expect them to come after the other Artifacts,

12:18.270 --> 12:20.560
but the rest of the
Artifacts are still there.

12:21.770 --> 12:23.930
You're right. So?

12:24.310 --> 12:26.310
What if we consider

12:26.310 --> 12:30.570
they don't know how to handle the Artifacts?

12:32.780 --> 12:35.750
In other words, they aren't coming to steal the Artifacts

12:35.750 --> 12:37.750
not because they don't want to,

12:37.750 --> 12:40.550
but because they're trying to figure out how the seals work.

12:41.120 --> 12:43.290
That may be the case.

12:43.290 --> 12:44.420
Then...

12:44.760 --> 12:48.390
We'll have to fight them again before long.

12:58.440 --> 13:01.270
It's awfully gloomy here.

13:01.640 --> 13:04.310
Are you up here as usual discussing

13:04.310 --> 13:06.110
something you shouldn't be?

13:06.250 --> 13:07.550
Ms. Fiona.

13:08.120 --> 13:09.120
Of course not.

13:09.120 --> 13:12.390
We wouldn't keep secrets from you, Ms. Fiona.

13:12.390 --> 13:15.550
Oh, really? I'm glad you trust me.

13:17.090 --> 13:19.360
I thought you were finished,

13:19.360 --> 13:21.330
but I seem to have interrupted you.

13:21.330 --> 13:22.590
I'm leaving.

13:26.930 --> 13:28.990
What's she doing here?

13:29.900 --> 13:31.900
Who cares?

13:33.170 --> 13:35.480
If Ms. Fiona were the Tamayori princess,

13:35.480 --> 13:37.780
I'd never get tired.

13:37.780 --> 13:40.250
I wish I could guard a hottie.

13:40.610 --> 13:43.480
Who wouldn't want a hottie?

13:40.780 --> 13:42.620
What does that mean?

13:42.620 --> 13:44.580
Calm down, Mahiro.

13:44.790 --> 13:50.380
Mahiro, you're losing a lot of favor with me right now.

13:51.530 --> 13:52.990
Tamaki.

13:55.700 --> 13:57.530
You're going home together again today?

13:57.530 --> 13:58.900
Yeah, I guess.

13:58.900 --> 14:01.200
That's just how it worked out.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.840
They draw lots, anyway.

14:02.840 --> 14:04.270
Why don't you confess to him already?

14:04.270 --> 14:05.470
Huh? What?

14:05.470 --> 14:09.340
I know you two are going out.

14:09.710 --> 14:11.270
You're lovey dovey, aren't you?

14:12.050 --> 14:15.480
No! I don't even like him!

14:19.550 --> 14:20.680
Let's go.

14:22.160 --> 14:23.690
See you, Kiyono.

14:23.690 --> 14:25.560
Later, lovebirds.

14:33.400 --> 14:34.900
Listen, Takuma.

14:34.900 --> 14:37.500
When I said I don't like you,

14:37.500 --> 14:40.000
I didn't mean I hate you.

14:40.370 --> 14:42.010
I'm grateful you're

14:42.010 --> 14:44.070
walking me home like this, of course.

14:46.010 --> 14:49.310
I'm going to go keep watch over the seals.

14:55.860 --> 14:58.020
I probably shouldn't have said that.

14:58.390 --> 15:02.330
He works so hard for me,

15:02.330 --> 15:04.090
and I said something terrible.

15:05.200 --> 15:06.930
Thinking about it won't do anything.

15:06.930 --> 15:09.840
Realizing my power is more important.

15:13.440 --> 15:15.500
Maybe I should apologize to him.

15:16.110 --> 15:17.540
I shouldn't think about that.

15:17.540 --> 15:18.770
I need to practice.

15:22.050 --> 15:24.680
It's no use. I can't focus.

15:29.220 --> 15:31.060
Huh? O-chan.

15:39.500 --> 15:40.800
Was that it?

15:40.800 --> 15:43.030
Was that what Grandma was talking about?

15:46.240 --> 15:47.830
<i>It's that same feeling.</i>

15:48.740 --> 15:50.440
Is it the seals again?

15:51.080 --> 15:53.050
I don't have time to think about it.

15:59.650 --> 16:01.050
Sorry.

16:01.760 --> 16:03.490
I'm in a hurry.

16:08.330 --> 16:11.130
Hey, how do you know Ugaya?

16:11.600 --> 16:13.430
You know Grandma?

16:12.830 --> 16:13.800
I see.

16:14.340 --> 16:16.330
You're that hag's grandchild.

16:16.840 --> 16:18.500
Hag?

16:24.680 --> 16:25.810
What are you doing?

16:25.810 --> 16:28.410
You smell interesting.

16:28.820 --> 16:30.820
You don't smell like Ugaya.

16:30.820 --> 16:32.490
Hey, stop.

16:32.090 --> 16:33.350
What's your name?

16:33.350 --> 16:34.150
Let go!

16:33.790 --> 16:35.140
Tell me your name.

16:36.390 --> 16:37.860
Tamaki Kasuga.

16:37.860 --> 16:39.030
Kasuga?

16:39.030 --> 16:41.000
How are you related to Ugaya?

16:41.000 --> 16:42.130
Why are you asking?

16:42.130 --> 16:43.390
Answer me.

16:43.930 --> 16:46.490
She's my maternal grandmother.

16:47.600 --> 16:49.760
I see, of course.

16:51.740 --> 16:53.040
Who are you?

16:53.040 --> 16:55.280
Don't start smelling like the old hag.

16:55.280 --> 16:56.140
What?

16:56.140 --> 16:57.040
Ouch.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.940
I don't have time for this.

17:00.450 --> 17:01.610
I need to hurry.

17:24.410 --> 17:25.630
You...

17:27.240 --> 17:28.230
<i>Why?</i>

17:28.780 --> 17:33.050
<i>She's the one who ordered them to attack.</i>

17:33.050 --> 17:34.810
<i>She's not scary at all.</i>

17:35.650 --> 17:38.380
Do you see something strange?

17:40.420 --> 17:43.480
It's not fear, respect, or rage.

17:44.290 --> 17:46.450
Why are you looking at me like that?

17:48.560 --> 17:50.900
Are you my enemy?

17:51.600 --> 17:52.930
Enemy?

17:53.870 --> 17:56.530
The next one is the...

17:59.710 --> 18:00.710
Tamaki!

18:00.410 --> 18:01.910
Get away from her!

18:01.910 --> 18:02.900
Wait.

18:05.750 --> 18:09.270
Sybil, I have come to awaken you.

18:10.720 --> 18:11.990
Sybil?

18:11.990 --> 18:16.450
You are keeping an object of unbelievable power.

18:17.260 --> 18:19.690
More power than you can imagine.

18:20.560 --> 18:25.520
Weaklings like yourselves cannot keep it forever.

18:26.930 --> 18:29.060
Logos will hold it.

18:29.440 --> 18:34.400
Instead of sealing it away, we will use it effectively.

18:34.940 --> 18:36.740
Leave the seal.

18:36.740 --> 18:39.110
I do not enjoy needless killing.

18:39.680 --> 18:43.240
If you leave, your lives will be spared.

18:44.820 --> 18:45.990
Answer me.

18:45.990 --> 18:49.510
But... But it's so sudden.

18:50.460 --> 18:54.050
Why are you trying to release Onikirimaru?

18:55.030 --> 18:57.030
The world could end.

18:57.030 --> 18:58.620
I will say it one more time.

18:58.970 --> 19:02.160
Forget about the seal, or die.

19:04.440 --> 19:07.310
I will protect the seal.

19:07.770 --> 19:09.440
I will protect everyone's lives.

19:10.110 --> 19:13.810
If you want it, you should ask for it first.

19:14.680 --> 19:17.620
You just suddenly showed up and hurt everyone.

19:18.190 --> 19:21.460
How can you tell us now to

19:21.460 --> 19:23.790
hand it over because you can use it better?

19:24.490 --> 19:25.460
It's not right.

19:27.530 --> 19:29.220
It's definitely not right.

19:30.000 --> 19:33.170
I still can't do anything as the Tamayori princess,

19:33.170 --> 19:35.660
and I don't know much about Onikirimaru.

19:36.340 --> 19:40.400
But I do know Onikirimaru is dangerous.

19:40.510 --> 19:43.600
I know it should never see the light of day.

19:44.110 --> 19:47.380
Even if you're telling the truth,

19:47.380 --> 19:50.250
I don't believe you'd use it well.

19:50.780 --> 19:52.190
What did you say?

19:52.190 --> 19:54.750
I will not let you have Onikirimaru!

19:57.660 --> 19:59.830
I am the Tamayori princess.

19:59.830 --> 20:03.660
When they saved my life,
I decided to do it.

20:05.370 --> 20:07.360
You choose death.

20:07.900 --> 20:10.300
If that is what you wish,

20:10.300 --> 20:13.570
I must give you what you want.

20:16.380 --> 20:21.510
Let us meet here again this time tomorrow.

20:26.420 --> 20:27.820
She left.

20:29.560 --> 20:31.490
Did she do something to you?

20:31.890 --> 20:36.260
No. I was just nervous.

20:36.560 --> 20:37.730
I see.

20:37.730 --> 20:40.570
But you told her.

20:40.570 --> 20:42.540
You were pretty cool.

20:42.540 --> 20:45.730
Well, I don't deny that.

20:46.910 --> 20:48.540
Let's go.

20:48.540 --> 20:50.530
The others must be worried.

20:53.150 --> 20:54.650
Can you stand?

20:54.650 --> 20:58.740
Sitting on your butt's a lot less cool.

20:59.420 --> 21:01.580
Huh? What?

21:02.190 --> 21:05.730
If you can't stand, I'll help you.

21:05.730 --> 21:07.700
I'll help you as often as you need.

21:08.230 --> 21:10.820
There's no reason to be so embarrassed every time.

21:24.580 --> 21:26.050
I see.

21:27.280 --> 21:33.550
Well, it's our job to watch what the two forces will do.

21:36.620 --> 21:40.720
It might not be obvious, but I'm thinking about it.

23:27.070 --> 23:29.400
It's time, O-chan.

23:37.810 --> 23:41.440
I'm glad I got to see you today.

23:43.050 --> 23:46.710
Could I see you again?

23:47.350 --> 23:51.420
I'll always be waiting here.

23:54.260 --> 24:01.070
Next Time: The Course of the Battle
